Looking at the error context, it seems the `AtomsProvider` is a required provider for Cal.com components. Let's add a mock `AtomsProvider` to wrap the component.

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/EventLimitsTab-99b7ab66.tsx">
